@startuml MemberB_State_ReviewJob
title Member B — State machine: ReviewJob (REQ-B-01, UC-03 / UC-08)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Queued : WorkPlan vN accepted

Queued --> Planning : OrchestratorAgent.plan()

Planning --> Running : tasks assigned
Planning --> AwaitingHuman : LLM plan invalid;\npractitioner must edit policy

Running --> Running : specialist TaskResult (pass)
Running --> AwaitingHuman : planned tasks done
Running --> Replanning : consistency fail /\nnew artefact /\nfinding NeedsMoreInfo
Running --> Cancelled : Practitioner abort

Replanning --> Running : validated patch;\nonly affected tasks rerun
Replanning --> AwaitingHuman : maxReplans exceeded\n(termination NFR)
Replanning --> Replanning : LLM proposes full restart;\npatch rejected; graph cut used

AwaitingHuman --> Replanning : dismiss / more info /\npolicy change (UC-09)
AwaitingHuman --> Completed : report issued (UC-07)
AwaitingHuman --> Cancelled : Practitioner closes without issue

Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Replanning
  LLM decides a patch;
  OrchestratorAgent enforces
  the deterministic dependency
  graph so the job cannot
  silently restart everything
  (protects REQ-B-01).
end note

@enduml
